      "content": "<p>Living closer to your workplace is quite an excellent improvement in living conditions. Bellandur, the rapidly growing sub-burb of Bangalore, is an especially relevant concept as there are always major hubs close to it in terms of IT. This article goes into the benefits of living close to your workplace within the context of Bellandur, focusing on factors like time saving, being economical, and how well it will improve your overall well-being.<br></p><h2><b>Proximity to IT Hubs</b></h2><p></p><p>Bellandur is a good place to stay if one works in the It industry since it is close to Whitefield, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sarjapura\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Sarjapur Road</a>, and Electronic City,Kormangala. This makes the moving around activities, such as traveling to and fro from work, not to consume much time.</p><p>That is good since traveling time is less and, therefore, stress is reduced, while you can spend more time at home; it also provides balance in work-life because you spend not a lot of time commuting to work. In simple words, staying in Bellandur makes work easy for the tech professionals who reach quickly at the workplace and have more time to stay at home.</p>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
      "content": "<p></p><h2><b><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000748012\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Benefits of Living Close to Your Workplace</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tochzwg8e8bu06y\",\"id\":\"toc_q2hsznepepei\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_q2hsznepepei\"> </span></b><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tochzwg8e8bu06y\",\"id\":\"toc_q2hsznepepei\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_q2hsznepepei\"><b> </b><br></span></h2><h3><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Time Savings</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocmp5dtjpu68yd\",\"id\":\"toc_9gwj0xj3ylo6\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_9gwj0xj3ylo6\"> </span></b><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocmp5dtjpu68yd\",\"id\":\"toc_9gwj0xj3ylo6\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_9gwj0xj3ylo6\"><b> </b><br></span></h3><p>The most important benefit of being next to work is that it saves quite a lot of time in commuting. Many professionals working in Bellandur may have to spend more time going back and forth to the daily commute to the IT parks such as Ecospace or  Embassy Tech Village. However, staying near would drastically cut this long hour.</p><p></p><p></p><table data-theme=\"{\" themename\":\"theme1\",\"themeobj\":{\"tblpr\":{\"cell\":{\"borders\":{\"border-top\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-right\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-left\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-bottom\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"}}}}}}\"=\"\" data-cols=\"[{\" wt\":\"2.958in\"},{\"wt\":\"1.958in\"},{\"wt\":\"2.104in\"}]\"=\"\" data-width=\"7.02in\" data-table-name=\"Table_1\" class=\"zw-table\" style=\"margin-left: 0in;\"><tbody><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-jc44zyeo1jt9\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 283.968px; height: auto;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Commute Time Comparison</b></span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(229, 231, 235); padding: 0px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 187.968px; height: auto;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Living in Bellandur</b></span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"2\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 0px; border-left-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(229, 231, 235); padding: 0px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 201.984px; height: auto;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Living Further Away</b></span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-hpwyrlwdokif\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 283.968px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Average Commute Time</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 187.968px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">15-30 minutes</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"2\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 201.984px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">45-90 minutes</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>On the other side, maybe you can then have extra free time to do other things or work on personal projects, so that you definitely save some time and really increase your productivity by the end of the day.<br></p><h3 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Cost Savings</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocyp89xp7fuko9\",\"id\":\"toc_yvfpo97jey6a\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_yvfpo97jey6a\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocyp89xp7fuko9\",\"id\":\"toc_yvfpo97jey6a\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_yvfpo97jey6a\"> </span></b></h3><p data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" class=\"zw-paragraph\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">This also brings the economical advantage of living close to the workplace. Commuting is expensive, especially during those times when fuel price increases and the cost of maintaining your vehicle is growing. The need to travel less distances saves you costs on:</span></p><ul data-list-id=\"42090941\" data-list-format=\"{\" level5\":{\"type\":8,\"startswith\":1},\"level4\":{\"type\":7,\"startswith\":1},\"level7\":{\"type\":7,\"startswith\":1},\"level6\":{\"type\":6,\"startswith\":1},\"level8\":{\"type\":8,\"startswith\":1},\"level1\":{\"type\":7,\"startswith\":1},\"level0\":{\"type\":6,\"startswith\":1},\"level3\":{\"type\":6,\"startswith\":1},\"level2\":{\"type\":8,\"startswith\":1}}\"=\"\" data-spl-bullet-format=\"{}\" style=\"list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial;\"><li><p class=\"zw-list zw-paragraph heading0\" data-header=\"0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-left=\"0.5in\" data-text-indent=\"-0.25in\" data-margin-bottom=\"6pt\" data-margin-top=\"6pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-list-id=\"42090941\" data-list-info=\"{\" id\":\"42090941\",\"l\":0}\"=\"\" style=\"margin: 6pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Fuel</span></p></li><li><p class=\"zw-list zw-paragraph heading0\" data-header=\"0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-left=\"0.5in\" data-text-indent=\"-0.25in\" data-margin-bottom=\"6pt\" data-margin-top=\"6pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-list-id=\"42090941\" data-list-info=\"{\" id\":\"42090941\",\"l\":0}\"=\"\" style=\"margin: 6pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Public transport fares</span></p></li><li><p class=\"zw-list zw-paragraph heading0\" data-header=\"0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-left=\"0.5in\" data-text-indent=\"-0.25in\" data-margin-bottom=\"6pt\" data-margin-top=\"6pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-list-id=\"42090941\" data-list-info=\"{\" id\":\"42090941\",\"l\":0}\"=\"\" style=\"margin: 6pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Vehicle wear and tear</span></p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Due to its cost-effectiveness, this living option is more desirable for many professionals in Bellandur.<br></span></p><h3><b>Health Benefits</b></h3><p data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000748012\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Such a commute would mean a lesser amount of time spent traveling, hence good health outcomes. Typically, long travel times are associated with increased stress and fatigue. Such a residence close to work may lead to:</span></p><ul data-list-id=\"28858829\" data-list-format=\"{\" level5\":{\"type\":8,\"startswith\":1},\"level4\":{\"type\":7,\"startswith\":1},\"level7\":{\"type\":7,\"startswith\":1},\"level6\":{\"type\":6,\"startswith\":1},\"level8\":{\"type\":8,\"startswith\":1},\"level1\":{\"type\":7,\"startswith\":1},\"level0\":{\"type\":6,\"startswith\":1},\"level3\":{\"type\":6,\"startswith\":1},\"level2\":{\"type\":8,\"startswith\":1}}\"=\"\" data-spl-bullet-format=\"{}\" style=\"list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial;\"><li><p class=\"zw-list zw-paragraph heading0\" data-header=\"0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-left=\"0.5in\" data-text-indent=\"-0.25in\" data-margin-bottom=\"6pt\" data-margin-top=\"6pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-list-id=\"28858829\" data-list-info=\"{\" id\":\"28858829\",\"l\":0}\"=\"\" style=\"margin: 6pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Lower stress levels</span></p></li><li><p class=\"zw-list zw-paragraph heading0\" data-header=\"0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-left=\"0.5in\" data-text-indent=\"-0.25in\" data-margin-bottom=\"6pt\" data-margin-top=\"6pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-list-id=\"28858829\" data-list-info=\"{\" id\":\"28858829\",\"l\":0}\"=\"\" style=\"margin: 6pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">More time for physical activities</span></p></li><li><p class=\"zw-list zw-paragraph heading0\" data-header=\"0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-left=\"0.5in\" data-text-indent=\"-0.25in\" data-margin-bottom=\"6pt\" data-margin-top=\"6pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-list-id=\"28858829\" data-list-info=\"{\" id\":\"28858829\",\"l\":0}\"=\"\" style=\"margin: 6pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Improved mental health</span></p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Reduced travel stress contributes immensely to total well-being as people have more spare time to rest and spend with the family.<br></span></p><h2><b><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000748012\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">Quality of Life in Bellandur</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocpcdt83posmqv\",\"id\":\"toc_xtdk06a7gwas\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_xtdk06a7gwas\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocpcdt83posmqv\",\"id\":\"toc_xtdk06a7gwas\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_xtdk06a7gwas\"> </span></b></h2><p></p><h2></h2><p></p><p></p>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
      "content": "<h3 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Access to Amenities</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc4pefuf24v1bq\",\"id\":\"toc_eojrv3jqw553\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_eojrv3jqw553\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc4pefuf24v1bq\",\"id\":\"toc_eojrv3jqw553\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_eojrv3jqw553\">&nbsp;</span></b></h3><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Bellandur is not only well-located but also abundantly amplified with multiple ammenities that upgrade experiences in everyday life. Plentiful restaurants, shopping malls, and recreational spots in the area dot the entire placescape.</span></p><p data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" class=\"zw-paragraph\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Here's a very concise description of some of those necessities:</span></p><p></p><table data-theme=\"{\" th