ight: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Iblur Lake,Jogger’s Park</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">All the facilities are available, so one gets everything that a person requires in close reach, but with the perfect balance between his or her work life and family life.<br></span></p><h3><b>Community Engagement</b></h3><p>The possibility of community living in Bellandur opens up ample scope for interaction with the community. Many high tech professionals already reside in the vicinity, and there are numerous options for networking. This is a creative-focused environment that fosters career advancement.</p><h3><b>Environmental Impact</b></h3><p>The other advantage of staying close to work is this helps the environment. Fewer cars on the road reduce traffic jams and carbon dioxide in the atmosphere. This, therefore, brings cleaner air and a sound community as a whole.</p>",
