      "content": "<h3 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Spontaneity in Daily Life</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocif4wju7ala8s\",\"id\":\"toc_r46uxuaojiwj\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_r46uxuaojiwj\">&nbsp;</span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocif4wju7ala8s\",\"id\":\"toc_r46uxuaojiwj\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_r46uxuaojiwj\">&nbsp;</span></b></h3><p data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" class=\"zw-paragraph\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000748012\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Staying within your place of work ensures enough flexibility when managing your daily time schedule. You can easily fit in some personal appointments or unexpected events without the stress of long commutes. For instance,</span></p><ul data-list-id=\"65379858\" data-list-format=\"{\" level5\":{\"type\":8,\"startswith\":1},\"level4\":{\"type\":7,\"startswith\":1},\"level7\":{\"type\":7,\"startswith\":1},\"level6\":{\"type\":6,\"startswith\":1},\"level8\":{\"type\":8,\"startswith\":1},\"level1\":{\"type\":7,\"startswith\":1},\"level0\":{\"type\":6,\"startswith\":1},\"level3\":{\"type\":6,\"startswith\":1},\"level2\":{\"type\":8,\"startswith\":1}}\"=\"\" data-spl-bullet-format=\"{}\" style=\"list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial;\"><li><p class=\"zw-list zw-paragraph heading0\" data-header=\"0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-left=\"0.5in\" data-text-indent=\"-0.25in\" data-margin-bottom=\"6pt\" data-margin-top=\"6pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-list-id=\"65379858\" data-list-info=\"{\" id\":\"65379858\",\"l\":0}\"=\"\" style=\"margin: 6pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Need to attend a family function? You can leave work early without worrying about traffic.</span></p></li><li><p class=\"zw-list zw-paragraph heading0\" data-header=\"0\" data-textformat=\"{\" size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-left=\"0.5in\" data-text-indent=\"-0.25in\" data-margin-bottom=\"6pt\" data-margin-top=\"6pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-list-id=\"65379858\" data-list-info=\"{\" id\":\"65379858\",\"l\":0}\"=\"\" style=\"margin: 6pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Want to grab lunch with friends? It’s just a short walk away.</span></p></li></ul><p data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" class=\"zw-paragraph\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">This also makes it conveniently enrich your overall quality of life.<br></span></p><h3 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><b>Enhanced Relaxation</b></h3><p data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" class=\"zw-paragraph\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\">Living closer to work also provides you with more time at home. Because you can travel home quickly after work, you do not worry much about how long you will spend getting home due to traffic jams or traveling. This time alone with the family allows you to have good moments with them or even to pursue your hobbies.<br></p><p></p><h2><b>Real Estate Considerations</b></h2><h3><b>Rental Price</b></h3><p>Over the last few years, Bellandur has seen a boom in the appreciation of real estate values.The demand for residential properties&nbsp; in Bellandur still continues to draw the attention of professional working in Bellandur. Be it <a href=\"https://www.kots.world/properties/bengaluru/Bellandur\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">apartments in bellandur&nbsp;</span></a>,villa or&nbsp; gated community, it offers a wide variety of choices in respect of diverse preferences and budgets</p><table data-theme=\"{\" themename\":\"theme1\",\"themeobj\":{\"tblpr\":{\"cell\":{\"borders\":{\"border-top\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-right\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-left\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"},\"border-bottom\":{\"color\":\"\",\"width\":\"1px\",\"type\":\"solid\"}}}}}}\"=\"\" data-cols=\"[{\" wt\":\"3.271in\"},{\"wt\":\"3.74in\"}]\"=\"\" data-width=\"7.01in\" data-table-name=\"Table_3\" class=\"zw-table\" style=\"margin-left: 0in;\"><tbody><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-0zu6ol04fvjs\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-width: 0px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(229, 231, 235) rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 0px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 314.016px; height: auto;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"siz