-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;₹&nbsp;20,000- ₹40,000</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-ok1mfvk12o4s\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 314.016px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3 BHK Apartment</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 359.04px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;₹50,000- ₹75,000</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2><b>Conclusion</b></h2><p>Bellandur does not just exist as a residential locality but as a thriving community, providing plenty of benefits. Strategic proximity to the IT hub lends it an excellent work-life balance among employees in this area; they do not have to bear much tension or waste much of their free time. Meanwhile, Bellandur evolves education, recreation, health, and cultural diversity, thus providing a complete environment to live.<br><br></p><p>If you're looking for your perfect home, check out urban gated apartments for rent in <b>Whitefield, Bellandur, Mahadevapura, Marathahalli, Sarjapura, Hennur, and Horamavu</b>—close to your workplace. Visit <a href=\"https://www.kots.world/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">KOTS.WORLD</a> today to explore the best options designed just for you.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p></p><p></p>",
